ry-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">11.40.5409<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 25, 2017<br/>Summer Update 2017</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20170713181123&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Diamond_Arrow_ee3a5e.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a diamond arrow.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by players of level 150 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.80 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Diamond arrows damage an area of 21 fields centred on the target (2 fields of radius), just like old <a href=\"#/wiki/Fireball%20Rune\">Fireball Rune</a> (before update in 2007). Since target will always be within the damage area, you will hit it even when you miss it. Blue Electricity Effects <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Blue Electricity Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blue_Electricity_Effect_56e9c8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> appears on the damage area.\n</p>\nDiamond Arrows are not affected by Bows <a href=\"#/wiki/Imbuing\">imbued</a> with Elemental Damage such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Powerful%20Frost\">Powerful Frost</a>. The damage they deal is always <a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\">Physical Damage</a>.<br/><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"scene_table canvas\" style=\"padding:32px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"caster-south\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20171019130455&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mage_Outfit_Male_White_7e3ebc.gif\"/></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect no_effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"missile_area\" data-horiz=\"200\" data-vert=\"200\" style=\"width:200%;height:200%;\">\n<div data-anim-dir=\"south-east\" style=\"position:relative;padding:0;width: 32px;height: 32px;z-index:2;animation:south-east 1s infinite !important;\">\n<div class=\"sprite\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20181011185715&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;frame=4\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Diamond_Arrow_Missile_8b01df.gif\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n</di